@{var events=ViewBag.Events as List<RaceDay.Mvc.Controllers.JsonEvent> ?? new();}<p class="eyebrow">PARTICIPANT SPACE</p><h1>Upcoming events</h1><p class="muted">Choose a challenge and make your next finish line count.</p><div class="row g-4">@foreach(var e in events){<div class="col-md-6"><div class="feature h-100"><span class="status">@e.Status</span><h3 class="mt-3">@e.Title</h3><p>@e.Description</p><p class="muted">@e.EventDate.ToString("dd MMM yyyy · HH:mm") · @e.Location</p><p>@e.Distance km · @e.EventType</p><small>To enrol, select an event category through the API. Category enrolment is not yet wired into this screen.</small></div></div>}</div>
